	'ip_consult_h1' => 'Book an owner consultation',
	'ip_consult_intro' => 'We offer a free 45-minute consultation at your property or by video to discuss how our management works, what your home requires, and what earnings range you might reasonably expect.',
	'ip_consult_label' => 'Owner consultation',
	'ip_consult_s1_h' => 'What happens during the 45-minute consultation',
	'ip_consult_s1_p' => 'Owner consultations take place from Tuesday to Thursday, lasting 45 minutes either in person at your home or through a scheduled video meeting. Maren Holt reviews the property layout, evaluates heating and hot water capacity, examines storage options, and discusses your personal usage goals. Within 5 working days following the meeting, Maren delivers a written management proposal. This document provides an estimated earnings range based on actual regional performance, explains onboarding steps, and details practical recommendations without ever making unrealistic revenue projections or inflated occupancy promises.',
	'ip_consult_s2_h' => 'What should I prepare for our meeting?',
	'ip_consult_s2_p' => 'To make the consultation as productive as possible, we recommend having five specific details ready. First, identify your property address, vehicle access, and on-site parking boundaries. Second, confirm bedroom configurations, bathroom facilities, and target guest capacity. Third, clarify your current letting status, whether the home is new to letting, self-managed, or moving from another agent. Fourth, gather information on recent heating servicing and safety checks. Finally, note any specific weeks throughout the coming year that you intend to reserve exclusively for personal family use.',
	'ip_consult_s3_h' => 'How quickly can my house welcome its first guests?',
	'ip_consult_s3_p' => 'Once you review our written proposal and sign the management agreement, onboarding proceeds immediately. Idris Calloway visits to capture professional photographs in natural daylight, measure a detailed floor plan, compile the house manual, and install a secure exterior key safe. We publish your listing across the big booking sites in five languages within 14 days of signing. Lucía Ferraz coordinates initial linen stocking and completes our baseline 40-point property check, allowing you to welcome your first paying guests approximately 3 weeks after signing.',
	'ip_consult_sub' => 'Forty-five minutes with Maren Holt, at the house or on video, and a written proposal within five working days.',
