	'ip_contact_s2_h' => 'Finding our Lenning office',
	'ip_contact_s2_p' => 'Our administrative office and central laundry are located at 14 Corn Exchange Yard in Lenning, within the Ostervale hills. The yard is situated directly behind the historic market exchange building, accessible via the cobbled archway off Market Street. While our regional leads and housekeeping managers frequently travel between homes in the Brennan valley, Marsh coast, and Upper Fells, our office desk is staffed throughout standard business hours to assist owners with keys, contract reviews, and scheduled consultation meetings.',
	'ip_contact_sub' => 'Email, telephone or the form below; the same desk answers all three within one working day.',
	'ip_fees_bar_btn' => 'Book an owner consultation',
