	'ip_fees_h1' => 'Fees and payouts',
	'ip_fees_intro' => 'We operate on a clear fee structure centered on 18 percent of nightly revenue, with zero commission taken on guest cleaning fees. You receive a fully itemised statement on the 2nd of each month and payout on the 5th.',
	'ip_fees_label' => 'Fees and payouts',
	'ip_fees_s1_h' => 'Our seven standard fee items',
	'ip_fees_s1_p' => 'Our full management service costs 18 percent of nightly revenue, covering listing optimization, dynamic pricing, guest communications, turnover scheduling, and monthly accounting. Initial onboarding is a one-time fee of €450, including photography, floor plans, house manual, key safe fitting, and translation into five languages. Turnover cleans are €70 for properties up to 2 bedrooms and €95 for 3 bedrooms or more, paid directly by guests and passed straight to cleaners. Linen and towels cost €14 per bed per stay. Small repairs cost parts at cost plus €35 per call-out, with your prior approval required above €150. Owner stays carry no management fee, only a €70 departure clean. Leaving requires 60 days notice with no exit fee.',
	'ip_fees_s2_h' => 'How do you set the nightly price and issue payouts?',
	'ip_fees_s2_p' => 'Priya Nair issues your monthly statement on the 2nd of each month, detailing every completed reservation, nightly rate, and direct cost. Payment is transferred directly to your bank account on the 5th. For co-owners who share a property, such as the Lindqvist siblings, we can split net earnings across multiple accounts on a single statement. We absorb all payment processing and card fees. Nightly prices are adjusted based on seasonal demand, local events, and minimum 2-night stay rules across our six regions to maintain healthy booking momentum without compromising property care.',
	'ip_fees_sub' => 'One percentage, seven plain items and a statement you can read at the kitchen table.',
	'ip_homes_cta' => 'Book an owner consultation',
	'ip_homes_h1' => 'Homes we run',
	'ip_homes_intro' => 'We manage 41 holiday cottages and farmhouses across six distinct regions, limiting our intake to at most eight new properties each season. Each home is cared for by local teams who live and work nearby.',
	'ip_homes_label' => 'Homes we run',
	'ip_homes_s1_h' => 'Regional distribution across our six areas',
	'ip_homes_s1_p' => 'Our portfolio consists of 41 homes across six regions: 12 in the Ostervale hills, 8 in Lenning town, 7 along the Marsh coast, 6 in the Brennan valley, 5 in the Upper Fells, and 3 beside the Saltmoor lakes. Henrik Dahl leads regional operations for the Upper Fells and Saltmoor lakes, coordinating local changeovers and maintenance. We maintain strict geographic boundaries so that our housekeeping vans and maintenance staff can reach any property within 30 minutes, ensuring prompt turnarounds and immediate support if a guest needs assistance.',
	'ip_homes_s2_h' => 'Selected properties in our care',
	'ip_homes_s2_p' => 'Our homes range from secluded stone farmhouses to compact market town retreats. In the Ostervale hills, Nadia Weller owns Weller farmhouse, a 3-bedroom property sleeping 6 that joined us in 2019. On the Marsh coast, Ruth and Samuel Okafor have trusted us with Brook Lane cottage, a 2-bedroom seaside home sleeping 4, since 2021. The Lindqvist family joined us in 2022 with the Mill House, a 4-bedroom valley retreat sleeping 8 in the Brennan valley. In the Upper Fells, Tomás Arrieta onboarded Orchard barn, a 2-bedroom converted barn sleeping 4, in 2025.',
	'ip_homes_s3_h' => 'The other thirty-five homes and seasonal limits',
	'ip_homes_s3_p' => 'Beyond these four properties, our portfolio includes 35 other houses, such as stone townhouses in Lenning and timber lodges beside the Saltmoor lakes. We deliberately cap our portfolio growth at no more than eight new properties per season across all six regions combined. This intentional cap prevents overextension, allowing Lucía Ferraz to personally oversee linen standards and Tomasz Wren to maintain firsthand familiarity with every plumbing system, boiler valve, and key safe across our entire network.',
	'ip_homes_sub' => 'Forty-one houses in six regions, all within thirty minutes of a van.',
	'ip_news_h1' => 'Owner waiting list',
	'ip_news_intro' => 'We limit new property onboarding to at most eight homes per season across our six regions. Joining our waiting list ensures you receive direct notification when management capacity opens in your area.',
	'ip_news_label' => 'Owner waiting list',
	'ip_news_s1_h' => 'Why we cap new property onboarding',
	'ip_news_s1_p' => 'Maintaining high standards requires disciplined geographic boundaries and realistic workloads. Lucía Ferraz oversees changeover cleans and 40-point inspections within a strict five-hour window, while Tomasz Wren personally inspects repairs and key safes. If we expanded without restriction, our response times would suffer and the quality of property care would decline. By capping new intake at no more than eight homes each season across all six regions, we ensure every house receives the meticulous attention and personal care that absentee owners expect from our team.',
	'ip_news_s2_h' => 'What to expect when you join the waiting list',
	'ip_news_s2_p' => 'When you submit your email to join the owner waiting list, your property details are recorded alongside your region, such as the Ostervale hills, Marsh coast, or Upper Fells. We never send generic marketing emails, sales pitches, or unsolicited promotional material. You will receive an email only when an opening becomes available in your specific regional cluster, with no more than four emails sent in any calendar year. Joining the waiting list is entirely free and carries no obligation to proceed with an agreement.',
	'ip_news_sub' => 'At most eight new homes a season. Tell us where yours is and we write when a place opens.',
	'ip_privacy_h1' => 'Privacy notice',
	'ip_privacy_intro' => 'Azukari Stays respects the privacy of property owners and guests. This privacy notice outlines how personal data is collected, stored, and managed from our office at 14 Corn Exchange Yard in Lenning.',
	'ip_privacy_label' => 'Privacy',
	'ip_privacy_s1_h' => 'What data we collect and how we use it',
	'ip_privacy_s1_p' => 'We collect personal information necessary to manage holiday lets effectively, including owner contact details, bank account details for monthly payouts, property utility documentation, and key safe access codes. For guests, we collect names, telephone numbers, and arrival times to facilitate self check-in from 16:00 and handle communications between 08:00 and 22:00. We process this information solely to deliver management services, execute contracts, and meet statutory accounting standards. We never sell, rent, or trade your personal data to external third parties.',
	'ip_privacy_s2_h' => 'Data storage, financial security, and owner rights',
	'ip_privacy_s2_p' => 'All owner records and financial statements are securely stored on encrypted systems managed by Priya Nair at our Lenning office. We retain transaction logs and monthly payout statements for the duration required by applicable financial and tax regulations. You have the right to request a copy of the personal information we hold about you, request corrections to inaccurate records, or ask for the deletion of personal data when our management agreement concludes, by contacting our team at owners@azukaristays.example.',
	'ip_privacy_sub' => 'How we look after the personal details owners and guests give us.',
	'ip_stories_cta' => 'Book an owner consultation',
	'ip_stories_h1' => 'Owner stories',
	'ip_stories_intro' => 'Many of our owners live hundreds of kilometers away or have inherited a family property that requires reliable local oversight. Here are the experiences of four owners whose homes we look after.',
	'ip_stories_label' => 'Owner stories',
	'ip_stories_s1_h' => 'Nadia Weller at Weller farmhouse',
	'ip_stories_s1_p' => 'Nadia Weller lives 900 km away from Weller farmhouse, a 3-bedroom stone house in the Ostervale hills that joined Azukari Stays in 2019. Living at that distance made coordinating changeovers and handling unexpected repairs impossible. Today, Idris Calloway photographs and markets the property, Lucía Ferraz manages the linen and cleaning, and Tomasz Wren oversees maintenance. Nadia receives detailed changeover photographs on turnover days and reviews her itemised payout on the 2nd of each month, knowing her home remains in immaculate condition without having to make long journeys to inspect it.',
	'ip_stories_s2_h' => 'Ruth and Samuel Okafor at Brook Lane cottage',
	'ip_stories_s2_p' => 'Ruth and Samuel Okafor placed Brook Lane cottage, a 2-bedroom whitewashed property on the Marsh coast, under our care in 2021 after retiring. They wanted the cottage occupied and earning during the busy spring and autumn months, but they reserved July for their own family holidays. Under our flexible owner-stay policy, the Okafors block their personal dates in the calendar without paying management commissions. They pay only the standard €70 turnover clean upon departing, leaving the house pristine and ready for incoming guests.',
	'ip_stories_s3_h' => 'The Lindqvist siblings at the Mill House',
	'ip_stories_s3_p' => 'Elsa, Jonas, and Mira Lindqvist inherited the Mill House, a 4-bedroom historic property in the Brennan valley, joining our portfolio in 2022. Residing in three different cities, the siblings sought a management arrangement that would remove administrative complexity and prevent disputes over maintenance expenses. Priya Nair manages their monthly statement so that all booking revenues, laundry fees, and minor repairs are consolidated into one clear report, with net proceeds automatically split three ways and deposited directly into their separate bank accounts on the 5th.',
	'ip_stories_s4_h' => 'Tomás Arrieta at Orchard barn',
	'ip_stories_s4_p' => 'Tomás Arrieta renovated Orchard barn, a 2-bedroom timber-and-stone property in the Upper Fells, joining Azukari Stays for his first letting season in 2025. After completing extensive renovations, Tomás needed a team capable of maintaining high decorative standards and managing winter weather demands. Henrik Dahl coordinates regional housekeeping and heating checks, while Idris Calloway produced architectural imagery and published the listing in five languages. Tomás enjoys consistent bookings from walking travelers while maintaining complete confidence that his investment is carefully protected throughout the year.',
	'ip_stories_sub' => 'Four owners who live somewhere else, and the houses we look after for them.',
	'ip_terms_h1' => 'Terms of management',
	'ip_terms_intro' => 'Our management terms are built on fairness, clarity, and operational transparency. We outline our mutual obligations below, covering notice periods, monthly payouts, owner stays, and repair approvals.',
	'ip_terms_label' => 'Terms',
	'ip_terms_s1_h' => 'How do I stop or end management?',
	'ip_terms_s1_p' => 'We do not believe in locking owners into restrictive long-term commitments. Our management agreement can be cancelled at any time by providing 60 days written notice to our Lenning office. During this 60-day period, we continue to manage existing bookings, clean and inspect the property, and provide full guest support. Upon completion of the notice period, we hand back all digital listings and photography, return physical keys, and charge no exit fee or early termination penalty whatsoever.',
	'ip_terms_s2_h' => 'Owner stays, damage protocols, and repairs',
	'ip_terms_s2_p' => 'Owners may block dates for personal stays at any time, provided those dates are not already reserved by a paying guest. We charge no commission or management fee for owner stays, only our standard turnover cleaning fee of €70 upon departure. Tomasz Wren and vetted local trades handle routine maintenance and accidental damage repairs, billing parts at cost plus a €35 call-out fee. We always seek your explicit approval before undertaking any non-emergency repair exceeding €150.',
	'ip_terms_sub' => 'A plain summary of notice, payouts, owner stays, damage and repairs.',
	'ip_thanks_h1' => 'We have your request.',
	'ip_thanks_intro' => 'Thank you for getting in touch with Azukari Stays. We have received your consultation request and look forward to learning more about your property.',
	'ip_thanks_label' => 'Thank you',
	'ip_thanks_link1' => 'See the fee sheet →',
	'ip_thanks_link2' => 'Read the owner stories →',
	'ip_thanks_link3' => 'Back to the home page →',
	'ip_thanks_s1_h' => 'What happens next with your request',
	'ip_thanks_s1_p' => 'Co-founder Maren Holt reviews every consultation inquiry personally. You will receive a direct reply by email or telephone within one working day to confirm a convenient time for your 45-minute consultation. Consultations take place Tuesday to Thursday, either at your property or via video link. During the discussion, Maren will explore your property layout, location, personal stay plans, and operational requirements before preparing a comprehensive written proposal with an estimated earnings range within 5 working days.',
	'ip_thanks_s2_h' => 'Exploring our services while you wait',
	'ip_thanks_s2_p' => 'While Maren reviews your details, you may find it helpful to review our fee sheet and owner resources. Our fee structure remains fixed at 18 percent of nightly revenue, with zero commission on guest cleaning fees, linen charged at €14 per bed, and small repairs billed at cost plus €35. You can also read through our owner stories to see how Nadia Weller, Ruth and Samuel Okafor, and the Lindqvist family manage their homes while living elsewhere.',
	'ip_thanks_sub' => 'Maren replies within one working day.',
	'ip_wwh_cta' => 'Book an owner consultation',
	'ip_wwh_h1' => 'What we handle',
	'ip_wwh_intro' => 'We look after holiday homes across our six regions from the initial listing through every changeover and guest question. Here is how each stage works in practice, from the day you sign to your monthly payout.',
	'ip_wwh_label' => 'What we handle',
	'ip_wwh_s1_h' => 'The five stages of management',
	'ip_wwh_s1_p' => 'We structure property management into five distinct stages: Listing, Turnover, Guests, Fees, and Payout. During onboarding, Idris Calloway photographs the house, draws a measured floor plan, and drafts a comprehensive house manual before listing the property in five languages within 14 days. Between 11:00 and 16:00 on changeover days, Lucía Ferraz oversees a complete clean, linen reset, and 40-point check. Amara Osei manages guest messages daily from 08:00 to 22:00. We charge 18 percent of nightly revenue, and Priya Nair delivers your statement on the 2nd with payment following on the 5th.',
	'ip_wwh_s2_h' => 'What happens during the 40-point changeover check',
	'ip_wwh_s2_p' => 'Every changeover takes place between 10:00 check-out and 16:00 check-in, giving our housekeeping team five clear hours to reset the home. Lucía Ferraz and her crew deliver freshly laundered hotel-weight cotton from our Lenning laundry and conduct our thorough 40-point inspection. We examine window stays, door latches, water pressure, appliance cleanliness, smoke alarms, and heating thermostats. We check that kitchen essentials are replenished, keys operate smoothly in the lockbox, and patio areas are swept. High-resolution photographs of the finished rooms are emailed to you that afternoon so you can see your home in order.',
	'ip_wwh_s3_h' => 'Can I still use the house myself?',
	'ip_wwh_s3_p' => 'You can stay in your own property whenever you wish. Owners have full access to our booking calendar and can block out personal dates at any time, provided no guest booking has already been confirmed for that window. We charge no management fee or administrative commission for owner stays. The only cost is our standard turnover cleaning fee of €70 when you leave, ensuring the house is thoroughly cleaned, freshly dressed with laundered cotton, and fully inspected before the next paying guests arrive at four in the afternoon.',
	'ip_wwh_s4_h' => 'Who holds the keys and what if something breaks?',
	'ip_wwh_s4_p' => 'Tomasz Wren fits a commercial-grade exterior key safe at onboarding and oversees key management. Guests access the property independently via secure code from 16:00, while our housekeeping and maintenance teams hold operational keys. If an appliance fails or a repair is needed, Tomasz or a vetted local trade responds promptly. For small repairs, we bill parts at cost plus a €35 call-out fee. Whenever a repair exceeds €150, we always contact you for prior approval before work begins, unless there is an active emergency endangering the structure.',
	'ip_wwh_sub' => 'Five stages, one named person for each, and a time you can hold us to.',
