	'own1_f' => 'Ostervale hills · 3 bedrooms · with us since 2019',
	'own1_q' => 'Living 900 kilometres away, I needed someone who looked after the farmhouse like an old friend rather than a spreadsheet. The stonework is sound, the rooms are pristine, and the accounts are entirely clear.',
	'own1_vt' => 'Nadia Weller · Weller farmhouse',
	'own2_f' => 'Marsh coast · 2 bedrooms · with us since 2021',
	'own2_q' => 'We retired to the coast but wanted the cottage lived in while we travel. We keep July for ourselves with no fuss, and the house is spotless when we come back.',
	'own2_vt' => 'Ruth and Samuel Okafor · Brook Lane cottage',
	'own3_f' => 'Brennan valley · 4 bedrooms · with us since 2022',
	'own3_q' => 'Inheriting the mill house as three siblings could have been complicated. One clear statement a month, split three ways, keeps the building cherished and all of us at peace.',
	'own3_vt' => 'The Lindqvist siblings · the Mill House',
	'own_h' => 'Three owners, three houses we keep',
	'pay_p' => 'Payouts are made on the 5th of each month for the previous month’s stays, with an itemised statement on the 2nd. Co-owners can split a payout across accounts on one statement, and booking site card fees are absorbed by us.',
