	'room_bathroom_h' => 'Bathroom: pressure, seals, towels',
	'room_bathroom_p' => 'Water pressure and drainage are tested, seals and silicone lines are checked, traps are inspected, and fresh towel sets are placed. A slow drain is found on a Tuesday by us, not on a Friday by a guest.',
	'room_bathroom_t' => 'Bathroom',
	'room_bedrooms_h' => 'Bedrooms: made up like a hotel’s',
	'room_bedrooms_p' => 'Mattresses and pillows are inspected and protected, freshly laundered hotel-weight cotton linen is dressed, window sashes are tested, and bedside lamps are checked. Photographs of the finished beds reach you the same day.',
	'room_bedrooms_t' => 'Bedrooms',
	'room_entry_h' => 'Entry: the first thing a guest meets',
	'room_entry_p' => 'We verify key safe operation, inspect the entrance lighting, check the weather strip, and set out arrival information with fresh seasonal flowers on the hall table. The door is never left for a guest to wrestle with.',
	'room_entry_t' => 'Entry',
	'room_kitchen_h' => 'Kitchen: tested, counted, restocked',
	'room_kitchen_p' => 'Every appliance is run, oven and extractor filters are degreased, crockery is counted against the house manual, and small essentials are replenished, so the first cup of tea is the easy part of the stay.',
	'room_kitchen_t' => 'Kitchen',
	'room_who' => 'Lucía’s team · every changeover',
	'room_yard_h' => 'Yard: raked, wiped, rolled out',
